/-!
# Stage 4 — Automorphic-to-Analytic Master Plug (`every_character_of_theta_integrals_local_matching`)

Bridges the automorphic theta-lift chain and Arakelov covolume bound (Stage 5) with the
Tate–Shafarevich supply `VWin` (Stage 3) and localized Landau front-end (Stage 2):
- `supplyChi`: rescales `VWinAt ψ 401` on `[W, W^2]` to host existence `HostExW (3/2)`.
- `nonempty_hyps_definite_side_of_closed_bound`: combines Siegel–Weil, Howe duality, the
  evaluation grid `GridA (max CF0 CF1)`, Arakelov/Bost covolume bounds (`hX`), and linked
  bundles `L3` to inhabit the definite-side theta-lift package `HypsAlt`.
- `shape_closed_link_n_of_green` + `topDesWin`: drives `HypsAlt` into `TopG`.
- `every_character_of_green_v_win` + `imprimitive`: fires `zeroFreeAll_of_topG` at Landau
  window exponent `la := 3 / 2` and extends from primitive to all Dirichlet characters.
-/

